{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land turned to ash, every bullet counts. The Last Zone blends fast-paced third-person combat with strategic base defense. Choose your weapons, lay traps, reinforce barricades, and plan against relentless waves of varied enemies. The wave system applies different pressure every run; you\u2019ll answer with a new solution each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.poster.avif?t=1761469874\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.webm?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/802e111bd907fb64dfacd70fd68b82f7.mp4?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources and complete side objectives to strengthen your arsenal, trigger special abilities at the right moment, and dismantle threats from shambling zombies to towering bosses. With Endless Mode, jump back in again and again\u2014each attempt demands a fresh plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast firefights + smart defense:</strong> Marries third-person shooter action with trap/barricade placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving enemy waves:</strong> Each wave hits harder; new types and behaviors force new tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/60ec364a9aa21aba722723453b94a077.poster.avif?t=1761469874\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/60ec364a9aa21aba722723453b94a077.webm?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/60ec364a9aa21aba722723453b94a077.mp4?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive arsenal:</strong> Swap between powerful weapons, upgrade, and customize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/4e3c66d2f8abb1c57d60d60d57c6c908.poster.avif?t=1761469874\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/4e3c66d2f8abb1c57d60d60d57c6c908.webm?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/4e3c66d2f8abb1c57d60d60d57c6c908.mp4?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trap &amp; barricade system:</strong> Build, reinforce, and chain trap combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/6d6b50a5374e0fe9b842fe0a22fdab2a.poster.avif?t=1761469874\" width=960 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/6d6b50a5374e0fe9b842fe0a22fdab2a.webm?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/6d6b50a5374e0fe9b842fe0a22fdab2a.mp4?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resources &amp; side objectives:</strong> Scavenge the zone, complete tasks, and boost your offense and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters:</strong> Face tough enemies with distinct weak points and patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.poster.avif?t=1761469874\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.webm?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/extras/b14ba32b5ecee1c1db7704154618c8bb.mp4?t=1761469874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability:</strong> Dynamic waves and upgrades keep every run fresh.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you outlast the apocalypse and become the zone\u2019s legendary defender?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988540?t=1761469874","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/9ce24f2120e78a3c7db40709b4b2645fba543f72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761469874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/601ba3840bf175914d72f5b5db8f0a7d69647004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761469874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988540/601ba3840bf175914d72f5b5db8f0a7d69647004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761469874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes"